{"unit_id":"Felalet__dsh-create-skills#feature-1","repo":"Felalet/dsh-create-skills","commit":"612009d1959c54765279f4748c2eacc8273630dc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Create Skills 的功能「目录预览与安装」：目录技能可先读取 SKILL.md 预览，再安装到项目或用户技能目录；也支持批量安装。 通过技能页面操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:703","client.js:1"]}
{"unit_id":"Felalet__dsh-create-skills#feature-2","repo":"Felalet/dsh-create-skills","commit":"612009d1959c54765279f4748c2eacc8273630dc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Create Skills 的功能「技能编辑与归档」：编辑技能名称、描述和 Markdown 内容；删除时可归档，并从归档恢复或永久删除。 通过技能页面操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:453","client.js:1"]}
{"unit_id":"Felalet__dsh-create-skills#feature-3","repo":"Felalet/dsh-create-skills","commit":"612009d1959c54765279f4748c2eacc8273630dc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Create Skills 的功能「版本管理」：可保存技能版本、应用历史版本、删除单个版本或仅保留最新版本。 通过技能页面操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1101","client.js:1"]}
{"unit_id":"Felalet__dsh-create-skills#feature-4","repo":"Felalet/dsh-create-skills","commit":"612009d1959c54765279f4748c2eacc8273630dc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Create Skills 的功能「技能对比与改进」：对比已安装或目录中的两个技能，调用 DSH 默认模型生成评价；也可给出改进要求并保存改写版本。 通过技能页面操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1363","client.js:1"]}
{"unit_id":"Felalet__dsh-create-skills#feature-5","repo":"Felalet/dsh-create-skills","commit":"612009d1959c54765279f4748c2eacc8273630dc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Create Skills 的功能「工作区技能迁移」：查看其他工作区技能并复制到当前工作区，也支持从多个工作区收集。 通过技能页面操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:876","client.js:1"]}
